## 10. ConversationMemoryService 设计

接口：

```java
public interface ConversationMemoryService {

    String resolveConversationId(String conversationId,
                                 Long knowledgeBaseId,
                                 String modelKey);

    ConversationMemory loadMemory(String conversationId);

    void saveTurn(String conversationId,
                  String userQuestion,
                  String assistantAnswer);

    void updateMemoryAfterTurn(String conversationId,
                               String userQuestion,
                               String assistantAnswer);
}
```

实现伪代码：

```java
@Service
public class ConversationMemoryServiceImpl implements ConversationMemoryService {

    private final ChatConversationMapper conversationMapper;
    private final ChatMessageMapper messageMapper;
    private final MemorySummaryService memorySummaryService;
    private final SessionStateService sessionStateService;

    @Override
    public String resolveConversationId(String conversationId,
                                        Long knowledgeBaseId,
                                        String modelKey) {
        if (conversationId != null && !conversationId.isBlank()) {
            return conversationId;
        }

        String newId = UUID.randomUUID().toString();

        conversationMapper.insertConversation(
                newId,
                knowledgeBaseId,
                modelKey
        );

        return newId;
    }

    @Override
    public ConversationMemory loadMemory(String conversationId) {
        ChatConversation conversation =
                conversationMapper.selectById(conversationId);

        List<ChatMessageEntity> recentEntities =
                messageMapper.selectRecentMessages(conversationId, 8);

        ConversationMemory memory = new ConversationMemory();
        memory.setConversationId(conversationId);
        memory.setSummary(conversation.getSummary());
        memory.setSessionState(parseState(conversation.getSessionState()));
        memory.setRecentMessages(toChatMessages(recentEntities));

        return memory;
    }

    @Override
    public void saveTurn(String conversationId,
                         String userQuestion,
                         String assistantAnswer) {
        messageMapper.insertMessage(conversationId, "user", userQuestion);
        messageMapper.insertMessage(conversationId, "assistant", assistantAnswer);
    }

    @Override
    public void updateMemoryAfterTurn(String conversationId,
                                      String userQuestion,
                                      String assistantAnswer) {
        memorySummaryService.updateSummary(conversationId, userQuestion, assistantAnswer);
        sessionStateService.updateSessionState(conversationId, userQuestion, assistantAnswer);
    }
}
```

